NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001951 "=head1 CONTRIBUTING"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001952 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001953 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001954 "To contribute, you can send patches by email/via RT, or send pull requests on"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001955 "GitHub."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001956 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001957 "Most of the time, you don't need to build the distribution yourself. You can"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001958 "simply modify the code, then test via:"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001959 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001960 " % prove -l"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001961 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001962 "If you want to build the distribution (e.g. to try to install it locally on your"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001963 "system), you can install L<Dist::Zilla>,"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001964 "L<Dist::Zilla::PluginBundle::Author::PERLANCAR>,"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001965 "L<Pod::Weaver::PluginBundle::Author::PERLANCAR>, and sometimes one or two other"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001966 "Dist::Zilla- and/or Pod::Weaver plugins. Any additional steps required beyond"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001967 "that are considered a bug and can be reported to me."
